  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Ever since the most recent update to VRC I can't jump anymore with the vive wands now. I've even messed with the controls and there's no option to apply a \"jump\" input to any of the buttons in the steam vr binds from what I could tell. I never changed the jump input before, so I don't know why up on the right trackpad/dpad doesn't seem to work anymore. I have another friend that also uses vive but it doesn't seem that the issue hit them, so I'm not sure what's up. And no, it's not the physical controllers that's the problem as I've attempted jumping with both controllers set as the right controller.",
